# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Power BI local cache / settings (never commit)
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf

# Generated migration outputs are reproducible from the source .twb -> keep them
# out of the repo so pushes stay small. EXCEPTION: agent-fragment.json is the
# agent-authored gap-fill (measures/visualDecisions); it is NOT reproducible
# without re-running the LLM, so it is kept under version control. A clone can
# then regenerate every .pbip deterministically via `migrate.py finish`.
Output/*
!Output/*/
Output/*/*
!Output/*/agent-fragment.json
